<title>JAPAN: Hikari Tsushin climbs on bargain hunting.</title>
<headline>Hikari Tsushin climbs on bargain hunting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hikari Tsushin Inc shares climbed on Thursday morning as investors hunted for bargains among over-the-counter issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0054 GMT, the shares stood at 6,420 yen after closing at 6,030 yen on the previous day. Hikari Tsushin provides telecommunications services.</p>
